    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d331-a1">

                <pb facs="0463" n="383" xml:id="pg383"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Dr.
                            Henriquez</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santo Domingo City</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-04-07"><hi rendition="#italic">April 7,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 200.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have been informed that you have under
                    arrest, by your Government, a Porto Rican citizen by the name of Maximo Mongé,
                    in business at Azua, the place where he was arrested, and forwarded from there
                    to the capital.</p>
                <p>I would be glad if you would inform me what are the charges against him, what
                    laws has he broken, or with what crime is he charged?</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. F. Powell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
